<item><title>São Tomé government completes cabinet with two appointments</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/st/sao-tome-government-completes-cabinet-with-two-appointments-ecbf1f/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/st/sao-tome-government-completes-cabinet-with-two-appointments-ecbf1f/</guid><category>Sao Tome and Principe</category><description>Economy Minister Orlando da Mata and Youth, Sport and Media Secretary of State Adnilson Rosa were sworn in at the presidential palace.</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 16:18:58 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/st/sao-tome-government-completes-cabinet-with-two-appointments-ecbf1f/share.jpg" length="42946" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/st/sao-tome-government-completes-cabinet-with-two-appointments-ecbf1f/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>São Tomé and Príncipe buys three 4x4 vehicles for new marine protected areas</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/st/sao-tome-and-principe-buys-three-4x4-vehicles-for-new-39bab1/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/st/sao-tome-and-principe-buys-three-4x4-vehicles-for-new-39bab1/</guid><category>Sao Tome and Principe</category><description>The vehicles will support the creation, operation and participatory management of the country&apos;s marine protected areas under an EU-funded project.</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 08:56:43 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/st.jpg" length="38731" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/st.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
